NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/memory.Pager.Activate kind=method
  digest=b3:1a561e4174e5a0f95a86699c253d0ef1b2c70f608eade1d30a5d2ad59f3d01bf file=neo/internal/memory/pager.go range=154:161 lang=go exported=true byte_range=5200:5732
  sig=func (p *Pager) Activate(conv, query string, budget cortex.Budget) (*cortex.ActivationBundle, error)
  doc=Activate composes the whole per-turn working set for a conversation via\ncortex.Activate (continuous-memory task 6.2): {Pinned, Timeline(T0),\nRecent(T1), Transcript(T2 slice), StorySoFar, ReachableURIs(T3 handles)},\nbudget-trimmed. Pinned is computed once per turn by cortex's per-turn cache\n(fixes NE-7). A thin delegate — no agent-side selection/ranking remains.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/memory.Pager
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/memory/pager.go

