  sig=type StructuralSelf cxself.StructuralSelf
  doc=StructuralSelf, FailurePattern, and SelfModel are the faculty-neutral\nself-model types, owned by matrix/cortex/self and aliased here so the\nconversation faculty and the execution faculty share ONE definition rather\nthan divergent per-faculty copies (self-model req.6.1/6.4).
EDGES
