  doc=deathMode extracts the failure MODE from a durable death summary: the loop\ndeath reason from the rich loop-state suffix ("reason=<mode>") when present,\nelse the failure class from the prefix ("class=<class>"), else "unknown".
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/memory/consolidate.go

